I think what's happening here is that we are trying to copy the tracing config from the control plane components to the tracing env vars of the control plane proxies.

I agree that since this is mainly used for control plane debugging, we have liberty over how the config is structured. So something like this makes sense to me:

```
# values.yaml
ControlPlaneTracing: false

# charts/partials/templates/_tracing.tpl
{{ define "partials.linkerd.tracing" -}}
- -trace-collector=linkerd-collector.{{.Namespace}}.svc.{{.ClusterDomain}}:55678
{{- end }}

# charts/partials/templates/_proxy.tpl
# if the whitespaces started to cause malformed YAML, try use `helm template` to debug or DM me
{{ if .ControlPlaneTracing -}}
- name: LINKERD2_PROXY_TRACE_COLLECTOR_SVC_ADDR
  value: linkerd-collector.{{.Namespace}}.svc.{{.ClusterDomain}}:55678
- name: LINKERD2_PROXY_TRACE_COLLECTOR_SVC_NAME
  value: linkerd-collector.{{.Namespace}}.serviceaccount.identity.$(_l5d_ns).$(_l5d_trustdomain)
{{ else if .Proxy.Trace -}}
